1
00:00:00,225 --> 00:00:02,935
Oh, dear. I'm gonna have to start again.

2
00:00:11,361 --> 00:00:14,071
(Raj:)If I could speak the language of rabbits...

3
00:00:14,531 --> 00:00:18,241
(Raj:)...they would be amazed
and I would be their king.

4
00:00:19,911 --> 00:00:22,411
(Leonard:)I hate my name.

5
00:00:23,582 --> 00:00:26,252
It has "nerd" in it.

6
00:00:28,545 --> 00:00:31,385
Leon-nerd.

7
00:00:32,799 --> 00:00:36,179
(Howard:)I lost my virginity to my cousin Jeanie.

8
00:00:38,013 --> 00:00:41,103
(Raj:)I would be kind to my rabbit subjects.

9
00:00:42,434 --> 00:00:44,724
(Raj:)At first.

10
00:00:45,270 --> 00:00:47,440
(Leonard:)You know what's a cool name?

11
00:00:47,606 --> 00:00:49,606
(Leonard:)Angelo.

12
00:00:50,567 --> 00:00:54,157
That has "angel" and "Jell-O" in it.

13
00:00:54,696 --> 00:00:56,366
(Howard:)It was my Uncle Murray's funeral.

14
00:00:56,531 --> 00:00:59,021
(Howard:)We were all back
at my Aunt Barbara's house.

